    "_string": "1. Unlock the Level of treasure chest using CP station VIP level. \n2. All SM in-game bets for 1 peso earn 1 level chest EXP, unlock chest rewards when the experience bar is full. \n3. Treasure Chest Rewards Reset progress and Treasure Chest Rewards every Monday at 8:00 AM (UTC+8 time zone). \n4. As the Level Chest is an additional bonus service, SM reserves the right to adjust the level and rules as needed.",
